--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,11 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Invalid static tool input schemas now fail when the tool is registered, with an error that names the tool. This lets applications catch configuration errors at startup.
+- Tool calls with input that fails the registered JSON Schema now return a readable tool result, allowing the assistant to correct the call. The executor receives only schema-valid input; applications that previously handled malformed input inside an executor should put those requirements in its schema.
+
